OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian, 93, struck by van dies
OL,4,Ain hospital                            
OL,6,FA 93-year-old man has died in hospital 
OL,7,Fafter being hit by a van in Reading.   
OL,9,FThames Valley Police said the man was  
OL,10,Fwalking on Beaconsfield Way, at the    
OL,11,Fjunction with Elm Lane, in Reading when
OL,12,Fhe was struck by a white Citroen Relay 
OL,13,Fvan on Friday at about 13:15 GMT.      
OL,15,FThe force said its thoughts were with  
OL,16,Fhis family and loved ones and urged    
OL,17,Fanyone who saw what happened and any   
OL,18,Fdrivers in the area who may have       
OL,19,Fcaptured footage on dashcams to come   
OL,20,Fforward.                               
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
